  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why does this happen",
      "char_file": "자명종_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Heel pain isn't just from",
        "being on your feet all day",
        "",
        "Your plantar fascia sits",
        "shortened all night - three",
        "habits pile more strain",
        "on top of that"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ramping Up Too Fast",
      "char_file": "운동화_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "First, ramping up your",
        "running or walking mileage",
        "too fast",
        "",
        "Your fascia needs weeks to",
        "adapt - skip that window and",
        "microtears pile up fast"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Build Up Gradually",
      "char_file": "운동화_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Increase your mileage or",
        "time on your feet just",
        "a little each week",
        "",
        "That gives your fascia time",
        "to adapt before it's overloaded"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cushionless Shoes, Hard Floors",
      "char_file": "슬리퍼_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Second, standing for hours",
        "in flat, cushionless shoes",
        "on hard floors",
        "",
        "With no shock absorption,",
        "every step's impact lands",
        "straight on that tissue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Choose Supportive Shoes",
      "char_file": "슬리퍼_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Pick shoes with real arch",
        "support and cushioning",
        "for long standing days",
        "",
        "Let your footwear absorb",
        "the impact, not your fascia"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "That First Step Out of Bed",
      "char_file": "자명종_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Finally, that very first",
        "step out of bed",
        "",
        "Your foot points down all night,",
        "so the fascia heals shortened -",
        "then your weight yanks it straight open"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Stretch Before You Stand",
      "char_file": "자명종_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Before you swing your legs",
        "out of bed, circle your ankles",
        "and stretch your calves",
        "",
        "That alone eases the",
        "shock of that first step"
      ]
    }
  ],
